  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A wave travels along a string. Graph M shows the variation with time of the displacement of a point X on the string. Graph N shows the variation with distance of the displacement of the string. PQ and RS are marked on the graphs.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of the wave?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{PQ}{RS}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"PQ\\times RS\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{RS}{PQ}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{PQ\\times RS}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
